Package: ch34x-mphsi-master-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms (>= 2.2.0.3), gcc, kmod, make
Recommends: linux-headers-generic | linux-headers-amd64 | linux-headers
Description: DKMS driver for WCH CH34x USB to SPI/I2C/GPIO adapters
 Kernel driver for WCH CH347, CH341, CH339 and CH9341 USB adapters.
 It provides SPI and I2C controllers, GPIOs and GPIO interrupts.
 .
 The module is built for the running and newest installed kernels when this
 package is installed, and is rebuilt automatically after kernel upgrades.
 Matching kernel headers and build tools are required.
